Error [E3305]: `core.net.ws` is not available for target `wasm32-wasip2`.
  --> tests/ui/wasip2_unsupported_websocket_e3305.jet:2:5
    |
  2 | use core.net.ws as ws
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: the selected target has no Prelude adapter for `core.net.ws`; WASI Preview 2 provides TCP/UDP sockets but not this operation.
 Fix: use a supported TCP/UDP operation, or build for a native target.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3305
